From 856b6d2a7f66fa33344d67165324985bc53ccda1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Czech texts of the settings added by the base

The settings that the GrapheneOS base adds to Android had Slovak texts
only (LECH OS patches 0001, 0003, 0004); other languages fell back to
English. This adds the Czech translation of the same texts: the settings
of the base (strings_ext.xml) and the per-app exploit protection screen.
---
 .../strings_app_exploit_protection.xml        |  91 ++++++
 res/values-cs/strings_ext.xml                 | 260 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 351 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 res/values-cs/strings_app_exploit_protection.xml
 create mode 100644 res/values-cs/strings_ext.xml

